@title Ghost Battle - reach a live race on Highland Cliffs and drive it
@game  PCSE00001
@shot-every 200

# ============================================================================
# WHY THIS PATH AND NOT TIME ATTACK
# `time-attack-lap.recipe` cannot reach its race on the current engine: selecting
# LAP TIME ATTACK faults at frame 9459 in the resource-group collector (the group
# is loaded and swept in the same frame). WORLD RACE -> GHOST BATTLE loads its
# course through the same streaming path and does NOT fault, so this is the
# route to a live race today.
#
# It is also a better race to have: GHOST BATTLE runs POSITION 2/2 against the
# built-in Default Ghost, so the HUD carries a real opponent and a lap timer.
# Nothing here needs a network - the Default Ghost ships with the title.
#
# EVERY COORDINATE BELOW WAS TAKEN FROM A SCREENSHOT OF THE SCREEN IT ACTS ON,
# in a resident session, not guessed. Panel coordinates are screen*2.
# ============================================================================

0: @section boot

# --- the mandatory first-run wizard, identical to play.recipe ---------------
# PLAY on the title screen (screen 480,420 -> panel 960,840)
1500: touch=960,840
1520:
